SDL-E1017 (spec/README.md#design-rules-settled)

  x `edgengram(x, 2)` is not a SurrealQL filter
   ,----
 1 | analyzer a { filters: edgengram(x, 2); };
   :                       ^^^^^^^|^^^^^^^
   :                              `-- not a SurrealQL filter
   `----
  help: filters are `ascii`, `lowercase`, `uppercase`, `edgengram(<min>, <max>)`, `ngram(<min>, <max>)`, `snowball(<language>)` with a bare language keyword, or `mapper('<path>')`
